=== Prompt ===
Who is Cloud Strife?

=== Response ===
Cloud Strife is the main protagonist of the popular role-playing game 'Final Fantasy VII,' released in 1997 by Square (now Square Enix). He is a former member of an elite military unit called SOLDIER, and a mercenary who joins an eco-terrorist group known as AVALANCHE to stop the megacorporation Shinra from draining the life of the planet.

Cloud is a skilled fighter, wielding a massive broadsword called the Buster Sword. Throughout the game, he discovers his true identity and the secrets surrounding his past, including his connection to Sephiroth, a powerful villain who seeks to control the planet.

Cloud's character is known for his brooding personality, complex backstory, and struggle with his own identity. His relationships with other characters, particularly Tifa Lockhart and Barret Wallace, are central to the game's story.

Cloud has since become an iconic character in the world of gaming, and has appeared in various forms of media, including movies, TV shows, and other games within the Final Fantasy series.

